  "ruleText": "We 603.04 Abandoned Wells. A well that has been abandoned, in accordance with We 604.03, shall be sealed as specified in We 604.04 through We 604.06.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 600) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
